.TH KLOGCTL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
klogctl \- invokes the linux syslog system call
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/klog.h>
.B int klogctl(int type, char* buffer, int length);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the Linux syslog system call. Operations and permissions depend on type and kernel configuration.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR syslog (2)
